# L16: a disabled function does not decode its ports and does not assert IORQGE
dip none
out FFFD F0
out BFFD 01
in FFFD
out 00FF 02
out 00B3 03
in 00BB
out 000F 04
dip gs
out 00B3 05
in 00BB
out FFFD 06
dip sd
out 000F 07
out 00B3 08
dip ym
out FFFD F1
in FFFD
out 00FF 09
dip saa
out 01FF 0A
out FFFD F8     # SAA clock off without the YM
